[00:01.00]
[00:01.00] Composed by：John Lennon
[00:14.00] Imagine there's no heaven
[00:14.00:zh] 没有天堂的世界会是怎样
[00:20.00] It's easy if you try
[00:20.00:zh] 想想 其实也很简单
[00:27.00] No hell below us
[00:27.00:zh] 脚下没有地狱
[00:33.00] Above us only sky
[00:33.00:zh] 抬头净是蓝天
[00:39.00] Imagine all the people
[00:39.00:zh] 试想象这样一幅画面
[00:45.00] Living for today
[00:45.00:zh] 人们都在为今天而活
[00:50.00] I
[00:50.00:zh] 我
[00:53.00] Imagine there's no countries
[00:53.00:zh] 不分国度的世界又会是如何
